WEBVTT

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:04.360
<i>I'm Ruka Suirenji.</i>

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:06.230
<i>Career: idol.</i>

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:07.980
<b>Ruka Suirenji</b>

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.830
<i>The days are tough,</i>

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:12.170
<i>but as long as I've got this...</i>

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:16.230
<i>Everyone, here we go!</i>

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:17.830
<b>Final Manuscript</b>

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:19.610
So, you've been booked to do

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:21.830
a commercial for this huge beverage maker!

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:25.330
Wh-When is the filming?

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:26.580
The day after tomorrow.

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:31.320
<b>Ruka Suirenji
1st Photo Book</b>

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:28.670
What? The day after tomorrow?!

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:30.700
Yes... Is there a problem?

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.750
You're so lucky, Ruka!

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.360
Imagine, such a big job just falling into your lap!

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:36.860
Um...

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:38.890
The president was thrilled, too.

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:41.780
The goddess of fortune 
really is on your side!

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:46.700
No... maybe you are the 
goddess of fortune!

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:47.890
This is wonderful!

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:48.930
I want udon...

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:50.020
Hey, are you listening, Ruka?

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.410
That Ruka...

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:30.900
When I see her this way, 
I realize she really is an idol.

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:35.860
When she lived here, 
she still had time off now and then.

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:38.550
It does bring back memories.

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:40.260
Sure does.

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:45.060
Home visit attack!

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:46.680
Bam!

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:49.800
Ruka...

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:50.810
...san?

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:51.970
Hi!

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:57.300
I've got trouble!

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:01.840
Is the udon good?

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:03.870
Yes, it is, but listen!

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:08.120
I don't know what to do anymore...

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:11.840
See, I've got this 
blah-blah-blah coming up...

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:15.630
Wow! To be booked for such a 
big commercial is amazing!

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:18.440
Yeah. My manager was thrilled.

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:21.040
I have the day off today, but...

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:23.250
Congratulations.

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:25.140
You'll have to try your 
hardest tomorrow, huh?

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:27.850
Yes! I have to try hard!

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:31.270
I have to... try hard.

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:35.250
Wh-What is going on here?

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:37.940
Looks like this is no small matter.

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:40.500
Something happened, didn't it?

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.820
No! I can't even tell you, Hayate-kun!

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:46.650
But... Wait a minute, Ruka-san.

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:48.540
If I can, I'll help you.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:50.040
B-But...

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:54.420
I'm always on your side.

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:03.510
Okay, I'll tell you. The thing is...

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:04.510
The thing is...?

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:07.930
The thing is, I...

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:10.430
can't ride a bike.

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:15.370
How are you going to film 
the commercial like that?!

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:16.810
I don't know!

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:18.850
But it's a really big job!

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:20.880
When I saw my manager so happy,

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:24.200
I just couldn't tell 
her to turn it down!

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:26.200
That's true...

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:31.600
You can't just refuse or put 
off such a big opportunity.

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:32.710
Yeah...

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:36.710
Luckily, you're off until 
the filming tomorrow. So...

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:39.600
Let's practice so you 
can learn to ride today.

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:40.410
What?!

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:41.590
That's insane!

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:43.260
It's not insane!

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:47.090
Well, maybe it is, but if you 
can learn how to ride...

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:49.100
But you know how bikes are like, right?!

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.790
Those things barely 
even touch the ground,

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.980
they clearly have poor balance,

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:58.110
and they can't even stand 
up without support!

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:02.150
Only a master or a god could 
ride one of those things.

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:05.360
Would a god need this much food?!

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:07.490
Hey! Give back my udon!

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:10.200
Anyone can learn to ride 
a bike with some practice!

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:13.890
Luckily for you, I was once the 
fastest bike delivery boy around.

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:15.500
I'm better at riding 
bikes than anyone else!

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:17.790
I'll help you...

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.670
So let's practice together.

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:23.600
Thanks...

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:27.970
So, I'm sorry, Miss Nagi, 
but my work today...

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.720
Yeah, I know.

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:31.640
Just put down the udon.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:32.710
It'll get soggy.

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:37.700
But, where will we practice?

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:39.280
Let's see...

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:42.650
Since you're an idol, we can't 
practice on the streets...

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:45.080
For the time being,

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:47.440
shall we attach training wheels 
and ride around the garden?

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:51.200
Okay... But, training wheels?

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.660
Is there a problem?

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:54.700
No, it's just...

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:58.010
They seem sort of childish and lame...

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:01.070
Is this the time to
 say things like that?!

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:03.670
I-I'm sorry!

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:06.420
Do you really want to 
learn how to ride a bike?!

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.450
He's like a drill sergeant.

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:06.420
Indeed...

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:10.920
Now, we don't have much time, 
so let's start practicing.

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:11.840
Okay.

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:15.220
Oh, Ruka, you're here? 
What are you doing?

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:18.440
Oh, Chiharu-san... Actually...

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:20.190
Hayate-kun!

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:22.150
Make it stop! Make it stop!

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:25.040
Does she have something 
against Maria-san's garden?

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:28.360
I've devoted tremendous 
effort to that garden!

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:30.470
Do you think raising vegetables is easy?!

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:30.470
She's really letting them have it...

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:32.940
It's the god's... no, 
the mother's wrath.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:38.210
We do have a problem. 
I didn't realize it was this bad.

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:40.400
Yeah... I'm sorry.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:43.370
And to top it all off, 
it's already dark.

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:45.460
Now, we have nowhere to practice.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:48.120
A place where no one can see you...

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:50.590
Oh! How about that one place?

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:58.320
It's been a while since I 
came to Hakuo at night.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:01.560
You've been here at night 
before, Ayasaki-kun?

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:05.480
Yes. Nothing good generally
 comes of it, though.

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:08.460
I look forward to seeing 
what tonight brings.

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:12.710
There.

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:16.620
At any rate, we need to make 
sure you can ride by morning.

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:18.670
In other words, we have four hours.

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:21.810
So, Ruka-san, please choose.

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:23.130
Huh? Choose what?

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:28.630
Naturally... whether I teach 
you kindly, or strictly.

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:33.150
Despite appearances, 
I was known as the fastest

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:34.570
in the professional bike delivery business.

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:37.890
When it comes to riding, 
I'm quite confident.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.840
However! In only four hours,

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:43.330
there's no guarantee you can 
master it if I teach you kindly.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:46.080
But if I teach you 
strictly, you can most

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:49.760
definitely master jackknife turns 
and even one-eighties in four hours!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.900
Are those even necessary?

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:54.330
Well, which will it be, Ruka-san?

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:56.160
Shall I be kind or strict?!

00:07:58.220 --> 00:08:00.650
I get it. All right, Hayate-kun.

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:02.380
When you put it that way...

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:04.580
I am a pro idol.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:06.820
I accept your challenge!

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:08.500
Teach me strictly, Hayate-kun!

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:11.800
Who are you calling "Hayate-kun"?

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:14.990
From here on, you'll call me Coach.

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:18.950
Fail to do so, and this water 
gun will relentlessly fire.

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:20.770
F-Forgive me, Coach!

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.680
Get on that bike right now!

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:23.830
Yes, Coach!

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:24.680
I can't hear you!

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:28.320
<i>I came along because I was 
worried about leaving them alone...</i>

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:25.810
Yes, Coach!

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:26.660
Still can't hear you!

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:27.570
Yes, Coach!

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:29.140
Are you willing to work?!

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:30.050
I am!

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:31.120
<i>But at this rate, I 
think they'll be okay.</i>

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:31.290
Then buckle down and get to it!

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:32.240
Yes, Coach!

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:34.140
<i>Maybe I'll go buy some drinks for them.</i>

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.010
You can speak louder than that!

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:35.240
I'm sorry, Coach!

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:39.900
But, Coach, how can I 
learn to ride a bike?

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:43.770
Good question. What's important 
is to be one with the bike.

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:44.790
One with the bike?

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:49.040
Yes. To feel as though 
the bike is a part of you.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:52.890
Once you feel that, 
you'll be able to ride.

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:53.800
Oh...

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:56.340
I've come up with a secret 
measure to help you do that.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:02.010
C-Coach! What is all this?!

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:02.960
What is it?

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:05.920
I've just tied your 
hands to the handlebars.

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:08.110
Why did you tie me up?!

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:10.970
Come, now. Tying you up...

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:12.780
...isn't all I'm doing.

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:17.100
Why did you bring me 
to a place like this?!

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:19.190
So you can ride all the 
way down, of course.

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:20.350
No way! No way! No way!

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:21.950
There's no way I can do that!

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:23.510
It'll be fine.

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:26.080
Humans can do anything 
when they're prepared to die.

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:28.170
But I'll actually die 
before I get to do it!

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:31.420
I-I can't do it, Hayate-kun. This is...

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:35.120
I am not Hayate-kun 
right now. I am Coach.

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:36.930
That doesn't matter right now!

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:38.430
Now, don't say that.

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:39.800
Let's go!

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.420
<i>I'm dying! I'm gonna die!</i>

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:50.520
You'll be fine as long as you 
keep the handlebars steady!

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.070
I can't do that!

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:54.990
If the tire bounces even 
the slightest bit—

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:57.610
<i>I'm dead.</i>

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.080
H-Hayate-kun?

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.580
See? You were just fine.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:13.290
What's most important is 
overcoming the fear of falling.

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:16.590
If you can do that, the bike will 
become your hands and feet.

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:18.300
No matter how close 
you come to falling,

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:21.050
I'll do something about it.

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:24.600
Just pedal with all your strength.

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:27.560
H-Hayate-kun...

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.490
Okay, ready to go again?

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:30.060
What?!

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:33.450
No! There's no way!

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:35.230
Fighting it won't do you any good!

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:44.090
You really are quite athletic.

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:47.510
You learned how to 
ride in no time at all.

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:49.760
I'm not sure if I should 
thank you for that.

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:53.190
You started to enjoy bullying 
me along the way, didn't you?

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:54.880
Oh, come on. Not at all.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.130
Shut up!

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:57.930
Here's what I think of you!

00:10:57.930 --> 00:10:59.590
Hey! Don't do that!

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:01.960
No way! I'll never forgive you!

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:04.100
Look, I'm soaking wet now!

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:10.030
Hold it right there!

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:12.360
Take that, Hayate-kun!

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:13.520
This is...

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:14.440
I'll get you!

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:18.300
Take that!

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:19.910
Hey!

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:21.230
There! There!

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:24.900
Ruka-san! Come on, cut it out!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:31.320
So, did Ruka learn how to ride a bike?

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:33.160
Yes, of course.

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:34.500
Oh?

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:41.210
Then... I can't ride either, 
so would you teach me next?

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:42.510
Sure.

00:11:42.850 --> 00:11:46.260
Would you rather I taught 
you kindly or strictly?

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.770
<b>Commercial Connecting Theater</b>

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:50.770
We're still going!

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:54.340
And so, this is the gentle route.

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:58.030
Someone who can't ride a 
bike starts by riding this.

00:11:58.340 --> 00:12:01.820
Don't worry, Miss. Despite 
what you're like inside,

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:04.620
on the outside you're a slightly large,

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:09.790
<b>Underdeveloped</b>

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:09.790
<b>Pigtails</b>

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:07.180
but underdeveloped and 
pigtailed schoolgirl.

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:09.790
<b>Schoolgirl</b>

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:09.790
So you won't look that 
unnatural riding this.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.620
Like I can ride that!

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.920
<b>Commercial Connecting Theater</b>

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:14.920
Ruka-chan!

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:17.660
I made some last-minute changes,

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:19.420
<b>Director</b>

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:19.800
so the commercial 
looks like this now...

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:22.360
She can't do tricks like that!

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:24.300
Y-Yes, I guess not...

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:26.820
A bunny hop? Okay, got it.

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:27.630
Huh?

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:41.180
I'm glad I could be 
of help to Ruka-san.

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:49.120
<b>Keep Going Toward 
the Big, Shining Sky</b>

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:42.860
Chiharu told me about it.

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:46.260
So you let your hidden sadistic 
side out again, huh?

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:50.050
Come on, don't call it sadistic...

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:54.000
It got us invited to the 
concert today, didn't it?

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:57.380
But...

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.380
Why are you guys here, too?!

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:02.670
Because we're the top idols of Hakuo!

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:04.760
We have to keep an eye on our rival.

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:06.800
Hey!

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:08.530
They're selling candy apples!

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:11.430
<b>Candy Apples  330 yen each</b>

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:10.850
Hayata-kun, buy me one!

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:17.940
Wow, she's really popular!

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:20.070
She has all these fans...

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:22.940
That's our rival for you.

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:31.570
Something wrong?

00:13:31.570 --> 00:13:33.720
No, it's just, well...

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:36.210
You guys go on inside.

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:39.310
Hey, where are you going? Hayate-kun!

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:40.090
<b>Ruka Suirenji</b>

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:44.800
Wh-What is all this?!

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.090
<b>Ruka Suirenji-sama</b>

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:47.490
Maid Star.

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:50.570
The maid who performs a 
circus-like entertainment dance.

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:52.880
That's the scenario.

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:54.080
Wow...

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:57.270
I really am a star among maids!

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:59.980
And why do I have to dress as 
a girl to be a backup dancer?!

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:03.110
I'm sorry! My backup 
dancer suddenly fell ill,

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:05.360
and there's no one to replace her...

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:06.430
Please!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.950
That really suits you!

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:12.980
Want to join our agency? 
You'd be like Ruka's little sister.

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:14.160
No, no, no!

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:16.460
Don't even joke about that!

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:18.120
Well, that aside...

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:19.750
This is the choreography.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:22.300
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:26.200
I really am sorry.

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:29.030
I've made so much 
trouble for you lately.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:32.480
But you're the only one 
I can depend on...

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:34.880
Ow...

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.840
I knew it. You're hurt.

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:40.900
I thought something seemed strange.

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:44.270
I went a little too far in rehearsal...

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:46.820
I fell off the rig.

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:46.320
<i>Ruka-san! Are you okay?</i>

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:53.840
Your left shoulder is hurt.

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:56.600
That's the side you usually 
hold the mic with.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:58.610
Maybe we should play it safe today.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:01.540
Thanks... But today...

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:04.920
I have to make sure my 
fans have a great time.

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:14.140
So... you won't do it?

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:18.040
If you mean the choreography, 
I've already memorized it.

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:18.680
What?!

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.390
Just leave it to me.

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:23.690
Even if I'm in a maid 
uniform, I am a butler.

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:25.960
Thank you!

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:29.190
Actually, I have one more request...

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.650
Ruka-san, I'm coming in.

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:40.210
A-Are you okay?!

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:41.960
Don't worry about me.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:43.110
I'm fine.

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:45.210
That favor I asked of you 
earlier is more important.

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:49.430
Oh... Getting your next costume 
ready after every three songs?

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:50.990
But, why me?

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:54.560
I don't want anyone to see that 
I'm hurt during quick changes,

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:57.220
so I don't want any staff 
in my wardrobe space.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.730
I understand...

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:05.640
I wonder where Hayata-kun went...

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:07.110
I bet I know.

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:10.210
He got hungry and went 
to buy tons of snacks.

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:12.760
That butler doesn't have 
that kind of money.

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:14.360
So he's eating food people 
dropped on the ground.

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:38.660
Ruka-chan!

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:41.950
<i>May I touch the hand reaching out to me?</i>

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:44.850
<i>The wind blows through my fingers</i>

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:51.150
<i>as I uncertainly reach to open the door.</i>

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.970
Everyone, here we go!

00:16:54.750 --> 00:17:00.720
Tiger! Fire! Cyber! Fiber! 
Diver! Viber! Jaa jaa!

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:06.480
<i>I felt certain that I've lived</i>

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:12.280
<i>The best I possibly could</i>

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:09.130
Wow, this is amazing...

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:11.130
Yay! Ruka!

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:18.640
<i>I don't aim too high,</i>

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:24.250
<i>But God is truly cruel</i>

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:21.140
She's really dancing...

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.140
She's moving so intensely.

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:25.400
Does it not hurt anymore?

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:30.320
<i>Dreams and reality are always in disagreement</i>

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:27.930
No, that can't be.

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:30.660
It hurts, but she's fighting it by force of will.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.680
<i>I don't know which...</i>

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:35.200
Three minutes until the next 
song! Quick change, please!

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:36.760
Maid Star!

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:38.770
Yes! Here's your next costume!

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:40.660
W-Wait...

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:44.160
Help me. The fans are waiting.

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:45.790
Right!

00:17:46.590 --> 00:17:49.630
<i>So this is a real, professional idol...</i>

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:52.290
Ruka-san! We reopen in 30 seconds!

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:53.430
Ready, Ruka-san!

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:55.050
Okay, I'm going!

00:17:58.240 --> 00:17:59.350
Thanks.

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:10.360
<i>I will face the chaos of this 
age I've been born into</i>

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:15.280
<i>All lies will turn into joy</i>

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:18.170
<i>Even if it brings pain,</i>

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:17.030
Ruka-chan!

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:22.640
<i>I will offer these unchanging feelings</i>

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:25.790
Almost time for the last song...

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:29.540
I'm amazed she really pulled it off.

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:34.440
Hi, cute little maid-san.

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:36.320
Have you seen a boy who looks

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:39.180
like a shabby butler around here?

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:46.480
Gilbert-san, why are you here?

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:48.690
From your attire, can I assume

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:50.290
that you're a fan of Ruka-san as well?

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:52.730
How do you know my name?

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:56.250
Hey! You're the indebted butler!

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:58.650
How dare you dress as 
a woman and catch me

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:00.540
off-guard when you know I love girls?!

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:03.260
That's low! Really low!

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:05.040
I won't let this one slide!

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:06.530
You'll rue the day you met me here!

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:08.960
To get my hands on the 
Sanzenin fortune,

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:11.950
today is the day I defeat you!

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:16.170
Hello. I am Idolbuster 961SP.

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:17.460
I love money!

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:20.750
Honestly, you are incorrigible...

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:23.720
But I won't let you interfere 
with Ruka-san's concert!

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:25.900
Ganaha!

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:29.800
Hey, isn't this one of the costumes 
for the final dance scene?

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:31.590
Aw, man! It's still here?

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:33.550
Come on, get moving!

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:34.760
You're almost on!

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:36.190
No! Wait! You've got the wrong guy!

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:38.690
Okay, here comes the last song!

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:49.250
Go! Cutie! Ruka-chan!

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.690
This says a bunch of 
people in animal costumes

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:54.930
always take the stage and 
dance during the last song.

00:19:54.930 --> 00:19:55.840
Wow!

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:57.190
How cute!

00:19:58.060 --> 00:19:59.890
What is that robot doing?!

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:01.760
Please do something about this!

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.840
No. There's nothing I can do.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:07.570
Come back right now!

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:16.440
Arri arri arri arri arri!

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:19.290
Looks like it's broken.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:20.210
Hey, you!

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:22.930
Probably because you 
kicked it around so much.

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:24.620
Hey! What's that guy doing?!

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:25.800
Get him off the stage!

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:28.330
We can't! He doesn't 
have an ear monitor on!

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:30.830
Then someone get him off the stage 
even if you have to kick him off!

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.000
Got it!

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:33.620
That's...

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:35.130
enough!

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:40.630
Hayate-kun?

00:20:43.070 --> 00:20:44.500
Looks like that's taken care of...

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.760
Oh, no! I'm on!

00:20:58.930 --> 00:20:59.800
Amazing!

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:02.230
So this is the kind 
of act they're doing.

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:04.240
Hayata-kun should have told us.

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:07.740
He looks frighteningly 
good dressed as a girl.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:14.710
<i>When the girl smiles, the 
whole world will smile, too</i>

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:18.710
<i>The fingers touching that pink 
labyrinth move in slow motion</i>

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:20.990
<i>Not even knowing how to feel pain</i>

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:29.140
<i>When the girl calls out, 
the boy turns around</i>

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:34.710
<i>And the night will be beautiful...</i>

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:37.020
Love me.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:41.780
<i>Like a silent warning</i>

00:22:03.110 --> 00:22:04.660
Here we go!

00:22:08.940 --> 00:22:11.620
Thank you all!

00:22:12.940 --> 00:22:16.810
Oh, no! I should thank you!

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:19.260
Good for you. They really liked you.

00:22:19.260 --> 00:22:21.590
You might as well just become a girl.

00:22:21.590 --> 00:22:23.470
Please don't say that...

00:22:23.470 --> 00:22:26.160
Hayate-kun, would you try this on next?

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:27.820
What?! No, no, no!

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:29.480
Don't talk like that!

00:22:29.480 --> 00:22:30.820
I'm telling you, I can't!

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:34.370
Come on! It might look 
really good on you!

00:22:30.850 --> 00:22:34.270
<b>Her wild solo concert 
Ruka Suirenji</b>

00:24:05.990 --> 00:24:10.100
Ruka, how do you feel about Hayate?

00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:11.110
What?

00:24:11.110 --> 00:24:11.970
How?!

00:24:11.970 --> 00:24:13.840
N-Nice Cutie!

00:24:13.840 --> 00:24:15.350
C-Cutie Mate!

00:24:15.670 --> 00:24:16.450
Hey!

00:24:16.900 --> 00:24:19.890
What was it I just asked you...?
